('click', { variant: variant }, function(e) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvar variant = e.data.variant;\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvariant.fn = variant.fn || $.sweetModal;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tvariant.fn.apply(this, variant.args);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t});\n\n\t\t</script>\n\n<div id=\"wrapper\"><!--used to set a width to the site-->\n\n<!--MAIN NAVIGATION (substitute # with your page link and move 'class=\"now\"' to the current page)-->\n<nav id=\"main\">\n<ul class=\"auto-style13\">\n<li id=\"access\"><a href=\"#content\">Skip navigation</a></li><!--enables people browsing without a mouse to skip the navigation-->\n<li><a class=\"now\" href=\"../index.html\">Home</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav><!--end main-->\n<!--END OF NAVIGATION-->\n\n<!--HEADER (contains your site name and/or logo) -->\n<header>\n<h1><img alt=\"\" height=\"344\" src=\"imgs/dismgtpmhdr.jpg\" width=\"960\"></h1>\n</header>\n<!--END OF HEADER-->\n\n<!--BREADCRUMB NAVIGATION to show visitors their location within the site-->\n<nav id=\"breadcrumbs\"><p><a href=\"/\">Home</a>  &gt;  <a href=\"#\">Previous Page</a>  &gt;  Current</p></nav>\n<!--END BREADCRUMBS-->\n\n<!--MAIN CONTENT-->\n<div id=\"content\" class=\"auto-style1\">\n<!--page heading-->\n<h2 class=\"auto-style2\"><span lang=\"en-in\"><span class=\"auto-style3\">Disease management module</span> - \n<span class=\"auto-style3\">Fungal</span></span></h2>\n<!--some intoductory text-->\n\n<!--CUTOUT BOX-->\n<article class=\"cutoutright\">\n<h3><span lang=\"en-in\">Bacterial &amp; Other Diseases</span></h3>\n<p class=\"auto-style1\"><span lang=\"en-in\">Bacterial Diseases : <span>They can \ncause a variety of symptoms including cankers, leaf spots, overgrowths, scabs, \nwilts, and others</span></span></p>\n<ul class=\"images\">\n<li><img src=\"anthra1/cankerleavess.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"79\" alt=\"cancker\"></li>\n\t<li></li>\n<li>\n<img src=\"anthra1/redrust1s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"95\" alt=\"Other\" style=\"left: 0px; top: 0px\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"auto-style1\"><span lang=\"en-in\">Others: <span>This disease attack can \ncauses reduction in photosynthetic activity and defoliation of leaves thereby \nreducing the vitality of the host plant.</span></span></p>\n</article><!--cutoutright-->\n<!--END OF CUTOUT BOX-->\n\n<!--a sub heading and some content-->\n<h3 class=\"auto-style7\"><span lang=\"en-in\">Fungal Diseases-\n<span class=\"auto-style14\">Die back</span></span></h3>\n\t<div>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style15\"><span>Caused by <em>Botryodiplodia theobromae</em></span></p>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style15\"><span>Discoloration and darkening of bark \n\t\t\tsome distance from the tip<span lang=\"en-in\">, </span>This blackness \n\t\t\tadvances</span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style15\"><span>Young green leaves start withering – \n\t\t\tfirst at the base and extends outwards along the vein</span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style15\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<h4 class=\"auto-style2\"><span lang=\"en-in\">Fungal disease - <strong>Die back</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"images-enlarge\" style=\"height: 228px; width: 544px;\"> <!-- Images enlarge on hover, see http://cssdemos.tupence.co.uk/image-enlarge.htm for an explanation-->\n<li><a href=\"anthra1/db1.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/db1s.jpg\" alt=\"die-back(thumbnail)\" height=\"109\" width=\"150\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/db1.jpg\" alt=\"Die-back (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"363\">\n<button id=\"tabbed1\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Die back</strong>: Discoloration and darkening of bark some distance from the tip. This blackness advances. Young green leaves start withering – first at the base and extends outwards along the vein</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 284px\"><a href=\"anthra1/db2.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/db2s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Die-back (thumbnail)\" style=\"float: right\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/db2.jpg\" alt=\"Benalmadena (larger image)\" width=\"509\" height=\"362\">\n<button id=\"tabbed2\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Die back</strong>: Discoloration and darkening of bark some distance from the tip\n</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"images-enlarge\" style=\"height: 149px; width: 528px;\"> <!-- Images enlarge on hover, see http://cssdemos.tupence.co.uk/image-enlarge.htm for an explanation-->\n<li><a href=\"anthra1/db3.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/db3s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"105\" alt=\"Die-back (thumbnail)\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/db3.jpg\" alt=\"Benalmadena (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"351\">\n<button id=\"tabbed3\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Die back</strong>: The affected leaves turn black and roll up, Twigs/ branches die, leaves shrivel and fall, Exudation of gum is also seen. </span></a></li>\n\n<li class=\"auto-style13\" style=\"left: 93px; top: 0px; width: 78px; height: 142px\"><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/db4.jpg\" alt=\"Benalmadena (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"336\">\n<button id=\"tabbed4\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Die back</strong>: It attacks the plant; as a result the twigs dry off. Internal discoloration is also seen on infected twigs.</span></a><a href=\"anthra1/die-back4.jpg\"><img src=\"anthra1/die-back4s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"101\" alt=\"Die-back(thumbnail)\" style=\"left: 91px; top: 4px; float: left\"></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"small\">(<span lang=\"en-in\"> Move mouse </span>over a thumbnail for a full sized version)</p>\n\t<p class=\"small\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t<div class=\"auto-style1\" style=\"width: 686px\">\n\t\t<span><span class=\"auto-style4\"><strong><span class=\"auto-style5\">Die back</span></strong><span class=\"auto-style5\">: \n\t\tIt attacks the plant; as a result the twigs dry off. Drying of twigs and \n\t\tbranches followed by complete defoliation gives the tree an appearance \n\t\tof scorching by fire. Discoloration and darkening of the bark occurs \n\t\tsome distance from the tip of the twigs.</span></span></span><span class=\"auto-style4\"><span class=\"auto-style5\"><!--and another sub heading and related content-->\n\t\t<span>The dark area advances and young green leaves start withering \n\t\tfirst at the base and then extending outwards along the vein. The \n\t\taffected leaves turn brown and its margins roll upward. At this stage, \n\t\tthe twig or branch dies, leaves shrivel and fall. This may be \n\t\taccompanied by exudation of gum. The infected twigs show internal \n\t\tdiscoloration. The association of a beetle (Xyleborusaffinis) has also \n\t\tknown to increase the disease incidence and hence need to be controlled \n\t\tfor disease management.<br></span> </span></span>\n\t</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n\n</div><!---content-->\n<!--END OF MAIN CONTENT-->\n\n<!--FOOTER (usuaully contains additional site info and navigation-->\n<footer>\n<!--FOOTER NAVIGATION (substitute # with your page link)-->\n<nav>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../index.html\">Home </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../Technologies.html\">Technologies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../var/varieties.html\">Varieties </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#\" title=\"\">Crop production</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../cropprotect.html\">Crop Protection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../cropimprove.html\">Crop improvement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../Technologies/machineries.html\">Machineries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../ContactUs.html\">Contact us</a></li>\n<li><a>Pest management</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav><!--end nav-->\n<!--END OF FOOTER NAVIGATION-->\n<!--SEARCH BOX-->\n<section id=\"footer-search\">\n<!--add your own search form here-->\n<form>\n<input id=\"term\" value=\"search the site\" onfocus=\"this.value='';\" onblur=\"if (this.value=='') {this.value='';}\"> <!--the content of value will appear in the search box until the box comes into focus-->\n<input id=\"searchbutton\" type=\"submit\" value=\